  "invariants": [
    "deterministic privacy/security policy precedes any cloud/OpenRouter call",
    "local-only never reaches OpenRouter or direct cloud",
    "local mission router chooses lane/model role/model; OpenRouter chooses only downstream physical provider within policy",
    "OpenRouter Auto never becomes privacy or final mission authority",
    "LCM and Mnemosyne are advisory context/memory, not execution authority",
    "orchestrator has no direct production coding authority after cutover",
    "worker cannot self-merge",
    "durable uplift state survives context/session loss and stores phase-boundary restart/adoption decisions"
  ]
